.DS_Store

# Dashboard build artefacts
node_modules/
.next/
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo
.vercel
.env
.env*.local

# Generated at build from data/*.csv — data/ is the source of truth, this is a copy
src/generated/

# Derived from data/ + today's date on demand. Not committed: it would churn daily and
# conflict on every concurrent session. Regenerate with `node scripts/build-findings.mjs`.
data/findings.json

# Local env files of any name. `.env.example` is re-included rather than relying on it already
# being tracked: on a fresh clone that is true, but the moment somebody deletes and recreates it
# the file silently stops being committed and every new chart loses its only documentation of
# which variables exist.
.env*
!.env.example

# The starter kit is BUILT from GETTING-STARTED.md, DASHBOARD.md, TROUBLESHOOTING.md and
# library/starter-kit/. Committing the output would give those docs a second home that goes
# stale the moment one is edited. Rebuild with `npm run starter -- --zip`.
build/
